research/audit/wave12-A9-dispatch/certifier-page-rn-as-a-normed-space.log-4088-[L2] Equivalence of norms is an equivalence relation, and $c M \le N \le C M$ with $c, C > 0$ is what it means ([[def-equivalent-norms]]).
