research/audit/wave12-A9-dispatch/certifier-def-vector-valued-derivative-and-integral.log-12595-the dictionary: equivalent norms give **Lipschitz** equivalent metrics, the
research/audit/wave12-A9-dispatch/certifier-def-vector-valued-derivative-and-integral.log-12596-strongest of the three tiers of [[def-equivalent-metrics]] and
research/audit/wave12-A9-dispatch/certifier-def-vector-valued-derivative-and-integral.log-12597-[[thm-metric-equivalence-hierarchy]], hence the same open sets, convergent
